      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10241162::web::036::adaptive_friction_interface_protection"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The engineered nanohierarchical structure will enable adaptive friction-interface protection from room temperature to 800 °C.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10241162::web::036::adaptive_friction_interface_protection"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "At low temperatures, the nanostructure will facilitate multiple deformation pathways, including dislocation activity and twinning.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::004::introduction",
        "PMC10241162::web::036::adaptive_friction_interface_protection"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The multiple deformation pathways will progressively accommodate or release gradient frictional stress during low-temperature sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10241162::web::004::introduction",
        "PMC10241162::web::036::adaptive_friction_interface_protection"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "At elevated temperature, the nanohierarchical structure will promote tribochemical reactions that form a dense nanocrystalline glaze layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10241162::web::036::adaptive_friction_interface_protection"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The high-temperature glaze layer will minimize adhesive wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10241162::web::036::adaptive_friction_interface_protection"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The high-temperature glaze layer will minimize oxidative wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10241162::web::036::adaptive_friction_interface_protection"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The adaptive glaze will act as a lubricious, self-lubricating interface.",
